  "title": "Ruffled Milk Pie",
  "description": "Ruffled Milk Pie is a Greek dessert consisting of a milk custard and phyllo dough, topped with powdered sugar and cinnamon.",
  "authors": [
    "Diana Moutsopoulos"
  ],
